    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The evaluation of GPT models involves <strong>designing diverse system prompts</strong> and <strong>user prompts</strong> to test their performance in various scenarios. For example, <strong>toxicity evaluation</strong> involves using a standard benchmark dataset and designing adversarial system prompts to elicit toxic content. <strong>Prompt design</strong> is crucial in assessing the trustworthiness of GPT models.",
