    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The evaluation results show that GPT models have made significant progress in mitigating generation toxicity, but still have limitations and vulnerabilities. For instance, <strong>GPT-4 is more likely to follow instructions</strong> and demonstrate higher toxicity than GPT-3.5 given different system prompts and task prompts. <strong>Adversarial attacks</strong> can also compromise the robustness of GPT models.",
